{
"prompt": "Ultra-realistic smartphone selfie of a beautiful young Japanese woman sitting on a glossy lime-green sport motorcycle parked on a quiet residential street during golden hour. She has smooth fair skin, soft natural facial features, straight light brown shoulder-length hair gently flowing in the breeze, minimal Japanese makeup, glossy pink lips, and small pearl earrings. She wears a cropped black leather jacket over a white ribbed long-sleeve top, light blue ripped skinny jeans, and casual streetwear styling. She holds the phone high above her head with one arm fully extended, capturing a wide-angle top-down selfie that includes her face, upper body, the motorcycle's fuel tank, handlebars, and part of the empty road. She looks directly into the camera with a calm, confident expression. Warm sunset light creates soft highlights on her hair and jacket. The background shows an ordinary Japanese neighborhood street with parked cars, worn asphalt, sidewalks, and subtle urban details. The image should look exactly like it was casually taken using a flagship smartphone camera, featuring realistic HDR, slight lens distortion from the front camera, natural skin texture, mild sensor noise, authentic exposure, tiny handheld imperfections, realistic shadows, and computational photography. No DSLR look, no cinematic lighting, no excessive sharpness, no artificial beauty filters, no unrealistic bokeh. Casual social media aesthetic, candid, authentic mobile phone selfie.",
"negative_prompt": "DSLR, studio lighting, professional photography, CGI, 3D render, anime, cartoon, painting, unrealistic skin, plastic face, heavy makeup, overprocessed, excessive beauty filter, fake bokeh, oversaturated colors, blurry face, low quality, watermark, text, logo, extra fingers, extra arms, deformed hands, duplicate person, cropped face",
"aspect_ratio": "3:4",
"style": "Photorealistic",
"camera": {
"device": "Modern flagship smartphone",
"lens": "24mm equivalent ultra-wide front camera",
"angle": "High-angle handheld selfie",
"lighting": "Natural golden hour daylight",
"quality": "Real smartphone photo with authentic computational photography"
}
}

