Design a set of **high-end fruit e-commerce packaging design schemes** for [Brand Name]. The product is [Product Name]. Brand positioning is [High-end Fresh Fruit / Direct Supply from Origin / Natural Organic / Light Luxury Gift]. Target audience is [Family Users / Gift Clients / Corporate Clients / Young Healthy Consumer Groups].

Packaging type is [E-commerce Shipping Box / Fruit Gift Box / Heaven and Earth Cover Gift Box / Drawer Box / Handheld Gift Box / Window Box / Corrugated Color Box]. Packaging dimensions, box structure, inner tray format, fruit quantity, buffer distance, ventilation hole positions, load-bearing structure, and material thickness must be automatically and reasonably designed according to the size, weight, shape, peel hardness, fragility, preservation needs, and characteristics of single fruit / cluster fruit / grain fruit of the [Fruit Variety] itself, conforming to real e-commerce transportation, cold chain delivery, gift giving, and factory mass production logic.

The overall style is [Minimalist High-end / Oriental New Luxury / Natural Organic / Fresh Healing / High-end Gift Box Style]. The picture is clean, high-end, appetizing, and has brand recognition; avoid cheap promotional styles. Use [Main Color Tone] as the primary color, paired with [Auxiliary Colors] and [Accent Colors], combined with the advanced expression of the fruit's own peel color, flesh color, leaf color, and origin temperament.

Please output a **professional fruit e-commerce packaging design proposal board**. A **large-sized main packaging display image** must be placed in the center of the frame, occupying 45%–60% of the overall frame, serving as the first visual focus. The main packaging is displayed in a 45° three-dimensional perspective, with a realistic box texture. The brand logo, product name, and core graphics are clear and eye-catching. It can be paired with a small amount of real fruit, leaves, origin elements, and gift cards as high-end scene embellishments.

Surrounding the main packaging are small-sized auxiliary modules showing: front, back, left and right sides, top, and bottom of the packaging, unboxing effect diagram, inner tray structure diagram, fruit placement schematic, unfolded dieline diagram, dimension labeling, material description, printing process description, color scheme, font scheme, and manufacturer production instructions. The auxiliary modules must be clear and orderly and must not seize the visual focus of the main packaging.

The internal structure must be designed according to the characteristics of the fruit:

Apples, pears, oranges, peaches, mangoes: Independent fruit position inner trays, fitting the fruit shape, anti-rolling, and anti-collision.
Strawberries, blueberries, cherries: Small fruit sub-compartment shallow trays, anti-pressure, retaining top clearance and ventilation holes.
Grapes, Shine Muscat: Whole cluster support structure, anti-shattering, anti-rolling, and anti-bruising.
Kiwifruit, citrus: Regular array fruit positions, enhancing stacking stability.
Durian, large heavy fruits: Reinforced corrugated structure, load-bearing reinforcement, strengthened handles and bottom support.
Mixed fruit gift boxes: Partitioned combination inner trays, different fruits in independent compartments, visually tidy, avoiding mutual squeezing.

The dieline diagram must be clearly marked:

Red solid line = cut line / knife line;
Blue dashed line = crease line / fold line;
Green line = bleed line;
Purple line = safety line;
Grey line = reference line;
Yellow area = adhesive position;
Translucent light blue area = window PET;
Light green area = ventilation holes;
Light brown area = inner tray / buffer structure;
Gold area = gold stamping plate;
Bright white area = spot UV;
Embossed shadow area = embossing / debossing.

Production requirements: All units are in mm, 3 mm bleed on each side, 5 mm safety margin, dimensional tolerance ±1 mm, die-cutting tolerance ±0.5 mm, printing registration tolerance ±0.3 mm. Reserves are needed for logistics face sheet area, barcode area, QR code area, traceability code area, food safety label area, and window PET pasting edges.

Material suggestions should be automatically matched based on fruit weight and fragility: [E-flute corrugated paper / B-flute corrugated paper / BE-double corrugated paper / 350g white cardboard / 400g white cardboard / specialty paper / grey board mounted paper / food-grade environmentally friendly cardboard].
Inner tray suggestions: [Pulp molded inner tray / honeycomb paper inner tray / corrugated partition / food-grade PET tray / degradable environmental paper tray].

Printing process: CMYK four-color printing, can include Pantone spot colors, gold stamping, spot UV, embossing, debossing, texture, touch film, matte film, water-based varnish, moisture-proof coating, and eco-friendly soy ink. The process should be restrained and high-end, mainly used for the brand logo, product name, origin patterns, seals, and core visual symbols.

Image style keywords:

large hero packaging mockup, oversized main fruit box display, premium fresh fruit ecommerce packaging, luxury fruit gift box, award-winning packaging design, production-ready packaging design, fruit-specific internal tray structure, custom fruit insert design, realistic corrugated box structure, ecommerce shipping box, dieline layout, structural packaging engineering drawing, CMYK print-ready layout, premium agricultural brand identity, elegant fresh color palette, realistic paper texture, refined typography, food-safe packaging design, ventilation holes, traceability QR code, logistics label area, photorealistic 3D mockup, clean white studio background, manufacturer-ready technical notes, ultra detailed, high resolution.

Forbidden:

low quality, blurry, messy layout, unreadable text, small main package, weak visual focus, generic inner tray, same insert for all fruits, wrong dieline, unrealistic box structure, unstable packaging, missing dimensions, missing bleed line, missing material notes, cheap template look, overdecorated design, incorrect barcode, spelling errors, unrealistic fruit placement, floating fruit, no protective tray, no ventilation holes, no shipping label area, fragile structure, wrong scale, cluttered composition.

